  "notes": "Complete 0-100 per sources. Roman spellings are common ASCII transliterations; variants listed. Fractions: paune = 3/4 of the NEXT named unit (e.g. paune do sau = 175), sawa = 1 and 1/4, saade = unit + 1/2 for units >= 3 (e.g. saade teen sau = 350), dedh = 1.5, dhai = 2.5. 'do' (2) collides with English 'do' — parser must use language context. Lakh-scale grouping (5,20,000) documented in PLAN 6.1."
